  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This engagement facility is to enable UNDP Pacific Offices Resilience and Climate Change (RCC) team to deliver results towards the Multi Country Programme Document (MCPD) outcomes, through this rapid and flexible mechanism to support an accelerated Implementation of the Unit in the areas of Climate security, disaster risk reduction and Renewable and sustainable energy, through intellectual services in the specific areas at both national and international levels.</narrative>
